@model PageMeta

<main>


  <!-- ==================== PAGE BANNER ==================== -->
  <section class="page-banner">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Admissions</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== ADMISSIONS CONTENT ==================== -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-layout">

      <div>
        <h2>Welcome to @School.Name Admissions</h2>
        <p>
          Choosing a school is one of the most important decisions a family makes.
          We're here to guide you through every step with warmth, clarity, and
          care. Our admissions process is designed to help us get to know your
          child — and to help you discover what makes @School.Name special.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-5">How to Apply</h2>
        <ol class="process-steps mt-3">
          <li class="step">
            <span class="step-num">1</span>
            <div class="step-body">
              <h3>Inquire</h3>
              <p>Fill out our online inquiry form or call the admissions office at (555) 123-4568. We'll send you an information packet and invite you to an upcoming open house or personal tour.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="step">
            <span class="step-num">2</span>
            <div class="step-body">
              <h3>Visit Campus</h3>
              <p>Schedule a tour and classroom observation. Experience our campus in action — meet teachers, see classes, and get a feel for the @School.Name community.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="step">
            <span class="step-num">3</span>
            <div class="step-body">
              <h3>Submit Application</h3>
              <p>Complete the application form and submit required documents: teacher recommendations, transcripts (Grades 6+), and a student questionnaire. Application fee: $75.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="step">
            <span class="step-num">4</span>
            <div class="step-body">
              <h3>Student Visit & Assessment</h3>
              <p>Prospective students spend a day at @School.Name attending classes and meeting peers. An age-appropriate assessment helps us understand their readiness and learning style.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="step">
            <span class="step-num">5</span>
            <div class="step-body">
              <h3>Enrollment Decision</h3>
              <p>Decision letters are mailed in March. Accepted families have two weeks to submit the enrollment contract and deposit to secure their spot.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>

        <h2 class="mt-5">Tuition & Financial Aid</h2>
        <p>
          @School.Name is committed to socio-economic diversity. Approximately 35% of
          our families receive need-based financial aid, with awards ranging from
          partial to nearly full tuition. We use a third-party service to assess
          each family's situation fairly and confidentially.
        </p>
        <p>
          Flexible payment plans — monthly, quarterly, or annual — are available.
          Please <a asp-action="Contact">contact our admissions office</a> for the
          current tuition schedule and financial aid application materials.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-5">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <div class="faq-list mt-3">
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>What are the age cutoffs for each grade?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">For Kindergarten, children must turn 5 by September 1 of the entry year. For all other grades, age-appropriate placement is determined during the admissions assessment.</div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Does @School.Name offer transportation?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">We offer bus service from several surrounding communities. Routes and fees vary by location. Carpool matching is also available for interested families.</div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Is before- and after-school care available?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">Yes. Our Extended Day Program runs from 7:00 AM to 6:00 PM for Lower School students, with supervised homework time, activities, and outdoor play. Middle School students have a supervised study hall until 5:30 PM.</div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>What is the student-teacher ratio?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">Our average student-teacher ratio is 12:1, with maximum class sizes of 18 in Lower School and 20 in Middle and Upper School.</div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Does @School.Name accept mid-year transfers?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">We consider mid-year transfers on a case-by-case basis, depending on space availability and the student's academic readiness. Please contact admissions directly to discuss your situation.</div>
          </details>
        </div>

        <h2 class="mt-5">Important Dates 2026–2027</h2>
        <ul style="list-style:none; padding:0;" class="mt-3">
          <li style="padding:0.5rem 0; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;"><strong>November 15, 2026</strong> — Fall Open House</li>
          <li style="padding:0.5rem 0; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;"><strong>January 31, 2027</strong> — Application Deadline (Priority)</li>
          <li style="padding:0.5rem 0; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;"><strong>February 2027</strong> — Student Visit Days & Assessments</li>
          <li style="padding:0.5rem 0; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;"><strong>March 15, 2027</strong> — Decision Letters Mailed</li>
          <li style="padding:0.5rem 0;"><strong>April 1, 2027</strong> — Enrollment Contracts Due</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Sidebar -->
      <aside class="sidebar">
        <h3>Ready to Apply?</h3>
        <p style="font-size:0.9rem;">Start your journey at @School.Name. We can't wait to meet your family.</p>
        <a asp-action="Contact" class="btn btn-primary" style="display:block; margin-top:0.75rem;">Inquire Now</a>

        <h3 class="mt-3">Downloads</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="#">Application Form (PDF)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#">2026–2027 Tuition Schedule</a></li>
          <li><a href="#">Financial Aid Application</a></li>
          <li><a href="#">School Handbook</a></li>
          <li><a href="#">Viewbook & Campus Guide</a></li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="mt-3">Contact Admissions</h3>
        <p style="font-size:0.85rem;">
          <strong>David Williams</strong><br>
          Director of Admissions<br>
          (555) 123-4568<br>
          admissions@@school.edu
        </p>
      </aside>

    </div>
  </section>


</main>
